Species
The number of species is disputed, with some authorities only accepting a single species, while others accept up to six species. Plants of the World Online accepts six species:
Eruca aurea {{small|Batt.}}
Eruca foleyi {{small|(Batt.) Lorite, Perfectti, J.M.Gómez, Gonz.-Megías & Abdelaziz}}
Eruca longirostris {{small|Uechtr.}}
Eruca pinnatifida {{small|(Desf.) Pomel}} (syn. E. sativa subsp. pinnatifida {{small|(Desf.) Batt.}}; E. vesicaria subsp. pinnatifida {{small|(Desf.) Emberger & Maire}})
Eruca sativa {{small|Mill.}} (syn. E. vesicaria subsp. sativa {{small|(Mill.) Thell.}})
Eruca vesicaria {{small|(L.) Cav.}}
